  "body": "Don't miss your chance to secure this stunning, standalone brand-new home!\r\n\r\nSpread across three beautifully designed levels, this spacious and luxurious residence delivers modern style, comfort and functionality - perfect for families, professionals or those looking for a home with that extra touch of something special.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n*\t4 spacious bedrooms\r\n*\t3 modern bathrooms\r\n*\tContemporary kitchen equipped with a dishwasher, oven and rangehood\r\n*\tOpen-plan living & dining\r\n*\tPrivate outdoor deck flowing seamlessly from the living area\r\n*\t2 car parks\r\n*\tDedicated laundry\r\n*\tAmple storage throughout\r\n\r\nA Lifestyle You'll Love\r\nDesigned to capture beautiful morning and afternoon sun, this home offers a warm, bright and inviting atmosphere throughout the day.\r\n\r\nAnd there's even more to enjoy right on your doorstep, with access to:\r\n*\tResidents' clubhouse\r\n*\tMultipurpose court\r\n*\tChildren's playground\r\n*\tBBQ area\r\n*\tPeaceful olive grove walkway\r\n\r\nWhether you're entertaining friends, enjoying family time or simply looking to unwind surrounded by nature, this home offers a lifestyle that's hard to beat.\r\n\r\nSecure your private viewing today and experience the space, style and lifestyle for yourself.\r\nCall now - your new home could be waiting!",
